THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

PanUrgos Studio includes or installs the following components, each under its
own license:

• llama.cpp (ggml-org) — MIT License. Bundled as the local model runtime.
• Electron — MIT License. Application framework (includes Chromium, BSD-style
  licenses; see resources in the install folder).
• Monaco Editor (Microsoft) — MIT License. Code editing engine.
• Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable — Microsoft Software License Terms.
  Installed only if it is missing from your PC.
• Optional developer runtimes (Git, Node.js, Python, .NET SDK, Eclipse
  Temurin JDK, Rust) are installed through Windows Package Manager (winget)
  from each publisher, under that publisher's license, only if you select them.

AI models are not included. Models you download from Hugging Face are subject
to the license stated on each model's page.

PRIVACY

PanUrgos Studio contains no telemetry. Setup does not send any information about
you or your PC. Optional components contact only their official publishers.
